@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontName Microsoft YaHei,SimHei,SimSun,sans-serif

title CNN v11 网络前向传播流程

participant "调用方" as Caller
participant "CNNV11Network.forward()" as Forward
participant "共享卷积体" as Body
participant "策略头" as PolicyHead
participant "价值头" as ValueHead

== 输入 ==

Caller -> Forward: x (batch, 3, 15, 15)

== 共享卷积体（256 通道） ==

Forward -> Body: Conv1(3→256, 3×3, p=1)
Body -> Body: BN1(256) → ReLU
note right: (batch, 256, 15, 15)

Forward -> Body: 残差块 1
Body -> Body: Conv2(256→256, 3×3, p=1) → BN2 → ReLU
Body -> Body: Conv3(256→256, 3×3, p=1) → BN3
Body -> Body: + shortcut (identity)
Body -> Body: ReLU

Forward -> Body: 残差块 2
Body -> Body: Conv4(256→256, 3×3, p=1) → BN4 → ReLU
Body -> Body: Conv5(256→256, 3×3, p=1) → BN5
Body -> Body: + shortcut (identity)
Body -> Body: ReLU

Forward -> Body: ...（残差块 3~6，同残差块 1 结构）
note right: Conv6~13, BN6~13

Forward -> Body: 残差块 7
Body -> Body: Conv14(256→256, 3×3, p=1) → BN14 → ReLU
Body -> Body: Conv15(256→256, 3×3, p=1) → BN15
Body -> Body: + shortcut (identity)
Body -> Body: ReLU
note right: 共享特征 (batch, 256, 15, 15)\n共 15 层 Conv + 7 残差块

== 双头分流 ==

Forward -> PolicyHead: conv_out(256→2, 1×1, p=0)
PolicyHead -> PolicyHead: BN(2) → ReLU
note right: (batch, 2, 15, 15)
PolicyHead -> PolicyHead: Flatten → (batch, 450)
PolicyHead -> PolicyHead: FC(450→225)
PolicyHead -> PolicyHead: LogSoftmax
note right: policy (batch, 225)

Forward -> ValueHead: value_conv_out(256→1, 1×1, p=0)
ValueHead -> ValueHead: BN(1) → ReLU
note right: (batch, 1, 15, 15)
ValueHead -> ValueHead: Flatten → (batch, 225)
ValueHead -> ValueHead: FC(225→256) → ReLU
ValueHead -> ValueHead: FC(256→1)
ValueHead -> ValueHead: Tanh
note right: value (batch, 1), 值域 [-1, 1]

== 输出 ==

Forward -> Caller: (policy, value)

@enduml
